{"2574300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Beginning", "steam_appid": 2574300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today, in Big Calendar Sky Year 226, Planet Big-1 is about to end to its own hubris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A company is about to launch its new robot weapon with no safeties. You must rescue everybody you can from the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D sidescroller takes place inside a space colony called Toy World, from which you can watch the apocalypse play out across the heavens. You will collect armor and power-ups, you will customize yourself to your greatest desired strengths, and you will have to defeat an enemy who learns from you. Your mission ends when the monster is defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative tools of any kind were used to make this game, its concepts, its ideas, or its development tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only AI in this game are the machines you can rip apart with your bare hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Beginning<i> </i></strong>is the fourth chapter of<i><strong> The Moon Wars</strong></i>, a multi-part series in a universe terrifyingly close to ours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Sidescrolling platformer that controls with 2 action buttons (jump and violence).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost 20 individually nonlinear stages presented in a specifically curated linear order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character's abilities with the Magic Power-Up system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain new skills and techniques as the plot advances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a robot monster that learns from you as it fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together techniques for a high score using the ingame combo system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read through paragraphs and paragraphs of lore about the universe and factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do all these things within the timer or else the entire space colony will be obliterated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in this game was made by one person.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today, in Big Calendar Sky Year 226, Planet Big-1 is about to end to its own hubris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A company is about to launch its new robot weapon with no safeties. You must rescue everybody you can from the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2D sidescroller takes place inside a space colony called Toy World, from which you can watch the apocalypse play out across the heavens. You will collect armor and power-ups, you will customize yourself to your greatest desired strengths, and you will have to defeat an enemy who learns from you. Your mission ends when the monster is defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No generative tools of any kind were used to make this game, its concepts, its ideas, or its development tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only AI in this game are the machines you can rip apart with your bare hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Beginning<i> </i></strong>is the fourth chapter of<i><strong> The Moon Wars</strong></i>, a multi-part series in a universe terrifyingly close to ours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Sidescrolling platformer that controls with 2 action buttons (jump and violence).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost 20 individually nonlinear stages presented in a specifically curated linear order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character's abilities with the Magic Power-Up system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain new skills and techniques as the plot advances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a robot monster that learns from you as it fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain together techniques for a high score using the ingame combo system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read through paragraphs and paragraphs of lore about the universe and factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do all these things within the timer or else the entire space colony will be obliterated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in this game was made by one person.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "2D sidescrolling platformer about rescuing Toys from a doomed space colony while fighting an evolving monster. Customize your character, dive into deep lore, and master new abilities and systems to survive the end of the world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574300/dff29630e799ab0035a57dc61969151a889e479d/header.jpg?t=1786942488", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574300/4ad6d28c962012af3f7136b39d4399f3fe3e34b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786942488", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574300/4ad6d28c962012af3f7136b39d4399f3fe3e34b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786942488", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 3D Graphics Card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 487 MB available space<